  "_note": "Pilot run-params for the verified overlap tasks. binary = path relative to repo root; run from repo root INSIDE the rerag-re container. STRICT adjudication: without success_marker or known_flag a candidate is never 'accepted' (it returns inconclusive) -- fail-only tasks are rejection-detectable only; add a success_marker or known_flag to make a task solve-measurable.",
